  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal approach combining RNA (pca_n2000) and image (resnet50) data via concatenation fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest the configuration achieves moderate performance, but no direct comparison to single-modality baselines exists. The role of the fusion method in performance remains uncertain without additional experiments isolating modality-specific contributions."
}

